        "detailed_description": "<h1>Join the Community</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/e4e778e9db1574a014706517c8104942.avif?t=1789121893\" width=780 height=124 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>eXoSpace Combat Engineer</strong> combines the gridless spaceship building of <strong>Reassembly,</strong> the intense combat of <strong>Nova Drift</strong>, and the unpredictable hyperjump encounters of <strong>FTL</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/b01b77a4f4a50f6f531dde6290a6ad2e.webp?t=1789121893\" width=780 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/c49bcdab55fff1772dc8d5cbc34e0853.poster.avif?t=1789121893\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/c49bcdab55fff1772dc8d5cbc34e0853.webm?t=1789121893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/c49bcdab55fff1772dc8d5cbc34e0853.mp4?t=1789121893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Using a fully <strong>gridless</strong>, intuitive snap-and-rotate designer, you balance weapons, thrust, energy and armor, use advanced mechanical parts like pistons and hinges to build <strong>transforming warships</strong>, or install hangars to deploy swarms of <strong>custom-designed drones</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/38dbb036f29836a4521ff129d201fa7c.webp?t=1789121893\" width=780 height=48 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/85c55fee7e04023c5580be7f487fda1b.poster.avif?t=1789121893\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/85c55fee7e04023c5580be7f487fda1b.webm?t=1789121893\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/85c55fee7e04023c5580be7f487fda1b.mp4?t=1789121893\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take your custom vessel into Bounty Hunt mode, navigating asteroid storms, pirate ambushes, and random encounters as you evolve your ship from a basic drone into a true dreadnought to survive intense, bullet-hell boss fights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2876200/extras/483de961ef66d48d77965170e53f840a.webp?t=1789121893\" width=780 height=48 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mission-based game loop</strong>: complete missions to increase in rank and build even bigger ships to hunt more dangerous targets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gridless spaceship designer</strong> that lets you easily snap parts together in any angle, allowing you to quickly try out new designs or upgrade your ship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Design your own drones</strong> and deploy swarms of them from your hangars.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intuitive engineering constraints</strong>: balance thrusters, weapons, energy and armor to create an effective warship.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bullet-hell boss fights</strong>: each mission ends with an epic phased boss-fight. Find weak points while dodging projectiles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A fully-featured <strong>sandbox</strong> allowing you to build any ship, create your own faction, and share it with a click on the Steam Workshop. You can even <strong>build your own boss</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Galactic Arena</strong>: face design and piloting challenges ranging from 1 vs 1 drone skirmishes to cruiser battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than<strong> 600 different ship designs </strong>to discover, including many community creations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than<strong> 200 parts </strong>to build your ship with, including powerful faction-specific weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 playable factions</strong> with their own tech tree, powerful unique parts, and crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more is added in <strong>regular updates</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>User Praise:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Again, awesome work. Been a while since I've been this impressed with such a hidden gem.&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“This game is ingenious, amazing and AWESOME! Something that fills the gap between Reassembly, Cosmoteer and Starsector.”</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“I like how here, I can quickly design something and experiment. I can iterate quickly and comfortably.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXoSpace is developed by Bas (@ Fantastimaker), a solo developer. No generative-AI was used to create this game.</p>",
