y-featured <strong>sandbox</strong> allowing you to build any ship, create your own faction, and share it with a click on the Steam Workshop. You can even <strong>build your own boss</strong>!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Galactic Arena</strong>: face design and piloting challenges ranging from 1 vs 1 drone skirmishes to cruiser battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than<strong> 600 different ship designs </strong>to discover, including many community creations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than<strong> 200 parts </strong>to build your ship with, including powerful faction-specific weapons.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>5 playable factions</strong> with their own tech tree, powerful unique parts, and crew.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And more is added in <strong>regular updates</strong>!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>User Praise:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Again, awesome work. Been a while since I've been this impressed with such a hidden gem.&quot;</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“This game is ingenious, amazing and AWESOME! Something that fills the gap between Reassembly, Cosmoteer and Starsector.”</i></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>“I like how here, I can quickly design something and experiment. I can iterate quickly and comfortably.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >eXoSpace is developed by Bas (@ Fantastimaker), a solo developer. No generative-AI was used to create this game.</p>",
